cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "Ottimizzazione su reti: online lecture notes with worked exercises"
abstract: >-
  The lecture notes of the Ottimizzazione su reti course — graphs, minimum spanning
  trees, shortest paths, network flows (maximum flow, minimum cost flow,
  transportation and assignment), the network simplex and project
  management — with definitions, theorems and proofs, worked examples and
  exercises with solutions.
